<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="card mx-auto shadow border-0" style="max-width: 700px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="card-header text-white text-center py-3" style="background-color: #046957;">
            <h4 class="mb-0 fw-bold"><i class="fas fa-file-contract me-2"></i> Terms & Conditions</h4>
            <p class="mb-0 small opacity-75 mt-1">Please read and accept before completing registration</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card-body p-4 bg-white">

            <% if (locals.errors && errors.length > 0) { %>
                <% errors.forEach(err => { %>
                    <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 small"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle me-1"></i><%= err.msg || err %></div>
                <% }) %>
            <% } %>

            <!-- T&C Content Area (Scrollable) -->
            <div class="border rounded-3 p-4 mb-4" style="max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto; background: #f8f9fa; line-height: 1.7;">
                
                <h5 class="fw-bold" style="color: #046957;">Terms and Conditions</h5>
                <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: September 2026</p>
                <hr>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    By registering and creating a family record (Vastipatrak) on the Machhu Kathiya Sai Suthar Gyati portal, 
                    you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, 
                    please do not proceed with the registration.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">2. Accuracy of Information</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    You agree that all information provided during registration, including but not limited to personal details, 
                    family information, contact details, and address, is accurate, complete, and truthful. Providing false or 
                    misleading information may result in removal of your record from the directory.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">3. Privacy & Data Usage</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    Your personal information will be stored securely and used solely for the purpose of maintaining the 
                    community directory (Vastipatrak). Your data will not be shared with third parties without your consent, 
                    except as required by law or for the legitimate functioning of the community portal.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">4. Community Guidelines</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    Members are expected to use this platform respectfully. Any misuse of the platform, including but not 
                    limited to uploading inappropriate content, harassment, or spamming, will result in account suspension 
                    or removal.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">5. Account Security</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials. You agree to notify 
                    the administrator immediately of any unauthorized use of your account. The portal administrators are 
                    not liable for any loss arising from unauthorized access to your account.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">6. Data Modification & Deletion</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    You may request modification or deletion of your family's Vastipatrak entry by contacting the portal 
                    administrator. The administrator reserves the right to verify your identity before making any changes.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">7. Disclaimer</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    The Machhu Kathiya Sai Suthar Gyati portal is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. 
                    The administrators do not guarantee uninterrupted access to the platform and are not responsible 
                    for any technical issues or data loss.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">8. Changes to Terms</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the portal after any such changes 
                    constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
                </p>

                <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">9. Contact</h6>
                <p class="text-muted small">
                    For any questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact the portal administrator.
                </p>

            </div>

            <!-- Agreement Form -->
            <form action="/terms-and-conditions" method="POST" id="tcForm">
                <div class="form-check mb-4">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="agreeTerms" name="agreeTerms" required
                           style="width: 1.2em; height: 1.2em; cursor: pointer;">
                    <label class="form-check-label fw-semibold ms-1" for="agreeTerms" style="cursor: pointer;">
                        I have read and agree to the <span style="color: #046957;">Terms and Conditions</span>
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                    <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-outline-secondary flex-fill py-2 fw-bold" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-2"></i>Go Back
                    </a>
                    <button type="submit" id="submitBtn" class="btn text-white flex-fill py-2 fw-bold" 
                            style="background-color: #046957; border-radius: 8px;" disabled>
                        <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2"></i>I Agree & Submit
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
// Enable/disable submit button based on checkbox
document.getElementById('agreeTerms').addEventListener('change', function() {
    document.getElementById('submitBtn').disabled = !this.checked;
});
</script>
